    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bean is a <strong>completely satire</strong> single player first person parkour game. To complete a level, collect the gold orb. Grapple onto the orange grapple blocks and complete a wide range of levels. There are 6 series and 10 unique levels. Your best time is saved and can be viewed in each level or in the 'Levels' menu.</p>",
